==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Kumamoto Prefecture'''. In the Taiwanese version, stage 4 is set in '''China''' and Thailand appears as the [[China (Empire of Cats)|previous stage]].
*Thailand's base is [[wikipedia:Wat Phra Kaew|Wat Phra Kaew]], the most sacred Buddhist temple in Thailand.
*Kumamoto Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Mount Aso|Mount Aso]], the largest volcano in Japan.
*Prior to [[Version 11.7 Update|version 11.7]], there were 8 extra [[Those Guys]] which spawned after bringing the enemy base down to 50% HP, with a delay of 1-4 seconds between each of Those Guys.

